  "text": "What happens when a star drops a banned film? Diljit Dosanjh just did it and chaos ensued. Zero promotion, no trailer, no countdown. Satluj dropped on ZEE5 like a surprise bombshell. Jaswant Singh Khalra exposed secret cremations in Punjab. His story? Uncovered by this daring film. Censors demanded 127 cuts. Filmmakers refused everyone, holding firm against three years of delay. Gone in 48 hours. But Gurdwara stepped up. Communities gather, keeping the story alive. Still streaming for NRIs. From Toronto to Melbourne, ZEE5 delivers Satluj worldwide. Five years to make this film. For the diaspora, it's not just a movie, it's a movement.",
